received for the treatment of osteoarthritis (Patient groups 1+2)\n-  Patients diagnosed with unilateral OA of the knee or hip planned for a treatment with THA or TKA (Patient groups 3+4)\n-  Age ≥ 30 years (Healthy control group)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patients with an unilateral THA",\n              "Modifier": [\n                "unilateral"\n              ],\n              "Procedure": [\n                "THA"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "THA"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "or TKA, which they received for the treatment of osteoarthritis (Patient groups 1+2)",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "TKA"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "TKA"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "osteoarthritis"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "osteoarthritis"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "received"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "received"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": ""\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patients diagnosed with unilateral OA",\n              "Modifier": [\n                "unilateral"\n              ],\n              "Condition": [\n                "OA"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "OA"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "lef