use of thrombocytopenia either immune or non immune as:\n-  Patients with diabetes\n-  HCV\n-  other autoimmune disease (as SLE or RA)\n-  Chronic Liver or kidney disease\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- We will"\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "NOT": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "exclude patients with any other possible cause of thrombocytopenia either immune",\n                              "Negation": [\n                                "exclude"\n                              ],\n                              "Other": [\n                                "other"\n                              ],\n                                "Condition": [\n                                "thrombocytopenia",\n                                "cause"\n                              ],\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "immune"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "thrombocytopenia"\n                              ],\n                              "Assertion": [\n                                "possible"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "or non immune as:",\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "immune"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n              