a urinary tract infection and previous treatment for SI. The removal criteria were patient non-compliance with the protocol, failure in contacting the patient and the patient\'s wish to withdraw from the study.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- The exclusion criteria were pregnancy, presence of a urinary tract infection",\n      "Condition": [\n        "pregnancy",\n        "urinary tract infection"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "pregnancy",\n        "urinary tract infection"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "and previous treatment for SI. The removal criteria were patient non-compliance with the protocol, failure in contacting the patient and the patient\'s wish to withdraw from the study.",\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "previous"\n      ],\n      "Study": [\n        "study"\n      ],\n      "Procedure": [\n        "treatment"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n        "previous"\n      ],\n      "Condition": [\n        "SI"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "SI"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
