omprehend and operate the technology at the discretion of the enrolling provider.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "Non-English Speaking. Any patient who is",\n      "Language": [\n        "English"\n      ],\n      "Negation": [\n        "Non"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "NOT": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "not able to comprehend and operate the technology at the discretion of the enrolling provider.",\n          "Negation": [\n            "not"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
