ails.\n- all entities: \'Contraindication\', \'Eq-Value\', \'Severity\', \'Drug\', \'Observation-Name\', \'Age\', \'Location\', \'Organism-Name\', \'Encounter\', \'Drug-Name\', \'Ethnicity\', \'Modifier\', \'Condition\', \'Eq-Unit\', \'Eq-Temporal-Unit\', \'Family-Member\', \'Organism\', \'Other\', \'Immunization-Name\', \'Polarity\', \'Condition-Type\', \'Immunization\', \'Eq-Operator\', \'Eq-Temporal-Recency\', \'Procedure-Name\', \'Indication\', \'Exception\', \'Study\', \'Language\', \'Coreference\', \'Provider\', \'Acuteness\', \'Life-Stage-And-Gender\', \'Procedure\', \'Risk\', \'Death\', \'Assertion\', \'Allergy-Name\', \'Specimen\', \'Negation\', \'Code\', \'Stability\', \'Birth\', \'Criteria-Count\', \'Eq-Comparison\', \'Condition-Name\', \'Insurance\', \'Observation\', \'Allergy\', \'Eq-Temporal-Period\'\n- the lists for the entity\'s should only be appended if one or more entities have been found. Otherwise, omit the arrays completely.\n\n5. The JSON object should be containing the following rules:\n- Ensure that the same logical operator ("AND", "OR", "NOT") does not appear on the same level of the tree structure to maintain the integrity of the logical relationships.\n- Generates JSON files from the textual criteria and organizing them into the described logical structure.\n- Setting the brackets {}, [] and commas, correctly in the JSON is extremely important.\n- Any double quotes within the raw textual criteria are escaped with a backslash (\\").\n- If there are no restrictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Patients who previously received anti-programmed death receptor-1 (PD-1) antibody, anti-programmed death ligand-1 (PD-L1) antibody, anti-programmed death ligand-2 (PD-L2) antibody or anti-cytotoxic T lymphocyte-associated antigen-4 (CTLA-4) antibodies, including those who have participated in a JS001 clinical study;\n2. Patients who previously received any TACE, radiofrequency ablation and other liver cancer treatments;\n3. Patients with a history of gastroesophageal varices or active cardia ulcers associated with a high risk of bleeding;\n4. Patients who have upper gastrointestinal hemorrhage within 1 year;\n5. Patients known to have fibrous layer HCC, sarcomatoid HCC or mixed cholangiocarcinoma and HCC; Other protocol defined inclusion/exclusion criteria could apply\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "1. Patients who previously received anti-programmed death receptor-1 (PD-1) antibody, anti-programmed death ligand-1 (PD-L1) antibody,",\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "received",\n                        "previously received"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                        "received",\n                        "previously received"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "anti-programmed death receptor-1",\n                        "anti-programmed death ligand-1",\n                        "PD-1) antibody",\n                        "PD-L1) antibody"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure-Name": [\n                        "anti-programmed death receptor-1",\n                        "anti-programmed death ligand-1",\n                        "PD-1) antibody",\n                        "PD-L1) antibody"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "anti-programmed death ligand-2 (PD-L2) antibody",\n                          "Procedure": [\n                            "PD-L2) antibody"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                            "PD-L2) antibody"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "or anti-cytotoxic T lymphocyte-associated antigen-4 (CTLA-4) antibodies, including those who have participated in a JS001 clinical study;",\n                          "Procedure": [\n                            "anti-cytotoxic T lymphocyte-associated antigen-4",\n                            "CTLA-4) antibodies"\n                          ],\n                          "Procedure-Name": [\n                            "anti-cytotoxic T lymphocyte-associated antigen-4",\n                            "CTLA-4) antibodies"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                            "participated"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "participated"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "2. Patients who previously received any TACE,",\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "received",\n                        "previously received"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                        "received",\n                        "previously received"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "TACE"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure-Name": [\n                        "TACE"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "radiofrequency ablation and other liver cancer treatments;",\n                      "Other": [\n                        "other"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "cancer"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "cancer"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "liver"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "radiofrequency ablation",\n                        "treatments"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure-Name": [\n                        "radiofrequency ablation"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "3. Patients with a history of gastroesophageal varices",\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "history"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "history"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "gastroesophageal varices"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "gastroesophageal varices"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or active cardia ulcers associated with a high risk of bleeding;",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "cardia ulcers"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "cardia ulcers"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "active"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "active"\n                  ],\n                  "Risk": [\n                    "risk"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "bleeding"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "bleeding"\n                  ],\n                  "Polarity": [\n                    "high"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "4. Patients who have upper gastrointestinal hemorrhage within 1 year;",\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "within"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "within 1 year"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "1"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "year"\n          ],\n          "Condition": [\n            "upper gastrointestinal hemorrhage"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "upper gastrointestinal hemorrhage"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "5. Patients known to have fibrous layer HCC,",\n          "Condition": [\n            "HCC"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "HCC"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "fibrous layer"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "sarcomatoid HCC or mixed cholangiocarcinoma and HCC; Other protocol defined inclusion/exclusion criteria could apply",\n          "Condition": [\n            "HCC",\n            "cholangiocarcinoma"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "HCC",\n            "cholangiocarcinoma"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "sarcomatoid",\n            "mixed"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
