art failure (New York Heart Association (NYHA) IV), severe COPD (need for chronic oxygen or mechanical ventilation), severe liver disease (Child-Pugh Class C), cancer requiring chemotherapy, or transplantation (bone marrow, heart, lung, liver, pancreas, or small bowel) in the past 6 months or likely within the next 6 months\n-  Previous episode of sepsis during that hospital admission\n-  Absolute Neutrophil Count < 500/mm³\n-  CD4 count < 50/mm³\n-  Treating physician deems aggressive care unsuitable (i.e. no commitment to active care)\n-  Participation in another interventional drug study within previous 1 month\n-  Allergic to the study drug or any of its components\n-  Lactation\n-  Have signed a Do No Resuscitate (DNR) Form\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "AND": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "- Known pregnancy",\n                                      "Condition": [\n                                        "pregnancy"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Condition-Name": [\n                                        "pregnancy"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "OR": {\n                                        "left": {\n                                          "raw_text": "- Underlying severe congestive heart failure (New York Heart Association (NYHA) IV), severe COPD (need for chronic oxygen",\n                                          "Condition": [\n                                            "congestive heart failure",\n                                            "COPD"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Observation": [\n                                            "New York Heart Association",\n                                            "NYHA"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                            "chronic",\n                                            "IV"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Assertion": [\n                                            "need for"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Modifier": [\n                                            "oxygen"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Severity": [\n                                            "severe"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Condition-Name": [\n                                            "congestive heart failure",\n                                            "COPD"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Observation-Name": [\n                                            "New York Heart Association",\n                                            "NYHA"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                            "chronic"\n                                          ],\n                                          "Eq-Value": [\n                                            "IV"\n                                          ]\n                                        },\n                                        "right": {\n                                          "OR": {\n                                            "left": {\n                                              "raw_text": "or mechanical ventilation), severe liver disease (Child-Pugh Class C), cancer requiring chemotherapy,",\n                                              "Condition": [\n                                                "liver disease",\n                                                "cancer"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Procedure": [\n                                                "mechanical ventilation",\n                                                "chemotherapy"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Assertion": [\n                                                "requiring"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Severity": [\n                                                "severe"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                                "liver disease",\n                                                "cancer"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Procedure-Name": [\n                                                "mechanical ventilation",\n                                                "chemotherapy"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                                "Class C"\n                                              ],\n                                              "Eq-Unit": [\n                                                "Class"\n                                           