n criteria to participate in this study.\n1. Evidence of lung nodule on chest radiograph or Computed Tomography regardless of underlying aetiology\n2. Age > 21 years old\n3. Ability to provide informed consent\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- The subject must meet all of the following inclusion criteria to participate in this study.",\n              "Study": [\n                "study"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "1. Evidence of lung nodule on chest radiograph",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "chest radiograph"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "lung nodule"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "chest radiograph"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "lung nodule"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or Computed Tomography regardless of underlying aetiology",\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "Computed Tomography"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "Computed Tomography"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "2. Age > 21 years old",\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            ">"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "years"\n          ],\n          "Age": [\n            "Age"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "21"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "> 21 years"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "3. Ability to provide informed consent"\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|