vere or active periodontal disease.\n-  Heavy bruxism or a traumatic occlusion.\n-  Acute or chronic dental infection.\n-  Pregnant or breastfeeding women.\n-  Patients with posterior restorations on molars or premolars\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Patients with a compromised medical history.",\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "medical history"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                        "medical history"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "compromised"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "- Severe",\n                          "Severity": [\n                            "Severe"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "or active periodontal disease.",\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "active"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                            "active"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "periodontal disease"\n                          ],\n                          "Condition-Name": [\n                            "periodontal disease"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Heavy bruxism",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "bruxism"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "bruxism"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "Heavy"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "or a traumatic occlusion.",\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "traumatic"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "occlusion"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "occlusion"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Acute",\n                  "Acuteness": [\n                    "Acute"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or chronic dental infection.",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "dental infection"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "dental infection"\n                  ],\n                  "Acuteness": [\n                    "chronic"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Pregnant",\n              "Condition": [\n                "Pregnant"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "Pregnant"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or breastfeeding women.",\n              "Condition": [\n                "breastfeeding"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n               