2. receive radical surgical resection\n3. have completed data of tumor location, histological type, behavioral characteristics or TNM staging\n4. have tumor specimens and either a valid microsatellite instability (MSI) or immuno-histochemistry (IHC) data\n5. have valid V-raf murine sarcoma viral oncogene homolog B1 (BRAF), kirsten rat sarcoma viral oncogene (KRAS), CpG island methylator phenotype (CIMP) results\n6. have at least 4 years of follow-up\n7. have valid time to local recurrence/metastasis in follow-up\n8. have clinical/treatment record data and valid preoperative status of intestinal obstruction or perforation (IOP), counts of lymph node removed in surgical resection.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "1. TNM stage I-II (T1-4N0M0) colorectal cancer cases",\n                                  "Eq-Value": [\n                                    "I",\n                                    "II",\n                                    "T1",\n                                    "4",\n                                    "0",\n                                    "M0"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "cancer"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition-Name": [\n                                    "cancer"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "colorectal"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                    "stage I-II",\n                                    "T1-4N0M0"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Unit": [\n                                    "stage"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "2. receive radical surgical resection",\n                                  "Procedure": [\n                                    "surgical resection"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                                    "surgical resection"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "radical"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                    "receive"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                    "receive"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "3. have completed data of tumor location, histological type, behavioral characteristics",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "tumor"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition-Name": [\n                                    "tumor"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "location",\n                                    "histological type",\n                                    "behavioral characteristics"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "or TNM staging",\n                                  "Observation": [\n                                    "staging"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Observation-Name": [\n                                    "staging"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "TNM"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "4. have tumor specimens and either a valid microsatellite instability (MSI)",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "tumor"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "tumor"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation": [\n                                "microsatellite instability",\n                                "MSI"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation-Name": [\n                                "microsatellite instability",\n                                "MSI"\n                              ],\n                              "Specimen": [\n                                "specimens"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "or immuno-histochemistry (IHC) data",\n                              "Procedure": [\n                     