ccording to international ATS and WASOG guideline\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "raw_text": "- Subjects with a definite diagnosis of sarcoidosis according to international ATS and WASOG guideline",\n  "Condition": [\n    "sarcoidosis"\n  ],\n  "Condition-Name": [\n    "sarcoidosis"\n  ]\n}<|eot_id|>']
