ence with at most two OLV in children\n-  Previous experience with at most two OLV in manikins\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Refusal to participate in study"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Previous experience with at most two OLV in children",\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "Previous experience",\n            "at most two"\n          ],\n          "Procedure": [\n            "OLV"\n          ],\n          "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n            "children"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "Previous experience"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "at most"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "two"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "OLV"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Previous experience with at most two OLV in manikins",\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "Previous experience",\n        "at most two"\n      ],\n      "Procedure": [\n        "OLV"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n        "Previous experience"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "at most"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "two"\n      ],\n      "Procedure-Name": [\n        "OLV"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
