n such that clinician recommends patient should not receive non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs or that patient requires acetaminophen to treat fever (ie suspected endometritis)\n-  Unplanned surgery (hysterectomy, bowel/bladder repair)\n-  Allergy or contraindication to study medication\n-  Non-English speaking\n-  Inability to provide informed consent\n-  History of opioid, other illicit substance, or alcohol use disorder either before or during pregnancy\n-  Severe renal or hepatic impairment\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "- Major intra-operative",\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "intra-operative"\n                              ],\n                              "Severity": [\n                                "Major"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "OR": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "or post-operative complication such that clinician recommends patient should",\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "post-operative"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "complication"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition-Name": [\n                                    "complication"\n                                  ]\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n               